{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-101-1","title":"Psalms 101:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David makes a vow and profession of godliness.</p>\n<p>I will sing. 89:1; 97:8; 103:6-8; 136:10-22; Ro 9:15-18,22,23; 11:22; Re 15:3,4 Re 19:1-3 unto thee. 71:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-2","title":"Psalms 101:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>behave. 6; 75:1,2; 119:106,115; 1Sa 18:14,15; 22:14; 2Sa 8:15; 2Ch 30:12 2Ch 31:20,21; Jer 23:5,6 O when. 40:17; 143:7,8 walk. Ge 18:19; De 6:7; Jos 24:15; 1Ti 3:4,5 a perfect. 1Ki 9:4; 11:4; 2Ch 15:17; Isa 38:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-3","title":"Psalms 101:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>set. 18:20-23; 26:4,5; 39:1; 119:37,113; Ex 20:17; 2Sa 11:2,3 1Ki 21:2-29; Job 31:1; Pr 6:25; 23:31-35; Ec 6:9; Isa 33:15 Jer 22:17; Ho 7:6,7; Mic 2:2; Mt 5:28; Jas 1:13-15 wicked thing. Heb. thing of Belial. 1Ki 21:13 I hate. 97:10; Ro 12:9 them. 14:3; 36:3; 40:4; 78:41,57; 125:5; Ex 32:8; Jos 23:6; 1Sa 12:20,21 1Sa 15:11; Isa 30:11; Zep 1:5,6; Ga 4:9; Heb 10:39; 2Pe 2:21 1Jo 2:19 it shall not. De 13:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-4","title":"Psalms 101:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>A froward. Pr 2:12-15; 3:32; 8:13; 11:20 know. 6:8; 119:115; Pr 9:6; 22:24; Mt 7:23; 2Co 6:14-16; 11:33; 2Ti 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-5","title":"Psalms 101:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Whoso. 15:3; 50:20; Ex 20:16; 23:1; Le 19:16; Pr 10:18; 20:19; 25:23 Eze 22:9; 1Co 5:11; 1Ti 3:11; Tit 2:3 an high. 10:2-4; 18:27; 138:6; 1Sa 2:3; Job 40:11,12; Pr 6:16-19; 30:13 Isa 2:11; Da 4:37; Ob 1:3,4; Lu 18:14; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-6","title":"Psalms 101:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Mine. 15:4; 34:15; 119:63; Pr 28:28; 29:2; Mt 24:45; Lu 12:43,44 Ro 13:1-4 that they. Joh 12:26; 14:3; 17:24; Re 3:20,21; 21:3 in a perfect way. or, perfect in the way. 119:1-3; *marg: Php 3:12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-7","title":"Psalms 101:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>He that worketh. 2Sa 4:10-12; 2Ki 5:26,27; Pr 29:12; Ac 1:16-20,25; 5:1-10 tarry in my sight. Heb. be established.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-101-8","title":"Psalms 101:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":101,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":101,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>early. 75:10; Pr 16:12; 20:8,26; Jer 21:12; Mic 3:1-4,9 cut off. 48:2,8; Ho 9:3; Mic 2:8-10; Re 21:27; 22:14,15</p>"}]}